XnF7m4d6UQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRHvEyNielCJEOBtVcfWZChbHC6lZCsdHOSKr8mKcoExw&oe=6B0B3FE6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PocusVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# PocusVR - Meta Quest Store Description\n\n---\n\n## **Learn Point-of-Care Ultrasound in Immersive Virtual Reality**\n\n**PocusVR** brings POCUS (Point-of-Care Ultrasound) education directly to your space with cutting-edge virtual reality technology. Perfect for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals.\n\n### **Training Areas:**\n- \ud83e\udec0 **Cardiac** - Rapid cardiac assessment and essential views\n- \ud83e\udec1 **Pulmonary** - Detection of pleural effusion and B-lines\n- \ud83d\udc0b **Abdominal** - Organ evaluation and free fluid assessment\n- \ud83d\udc80 **Cranial** - Transcranial ultrasound and measurements\n- \ud83e\ude78 **Doppler Color** - Real-time vascular flow analysis\n- \ud83e\uddb5 **Inguinal** - Assessment of vessels and inguinal region structures\n- \ud83e\uddb5 **Popliteal** - Popliteal region and vascular structure ultrasound\n\n### **Features:**\n\u2713 Realistic simulation with accurate anatomical models  \n\u2713 Immediate feedback on technique and findings  \n\u2713 Step-by-step protocols easy to follow  \n\u2713 Unlimited practice in a safe environment  \n\u2713 Intuitive virtual reality interface  \n\n### **Ideal For:**\nEmergency medicine physicians, critical care specialists, urgent care providers, anesthesiologists, and medical students.\n\n---\n\n**Master POCUS with confidence from anywhere!**\n\n{2416345472161976}\n{964784835962575}\n{2203614260390719}\n{814953447905793}\n{2134594520661540}\n{1661401091666738}", "short_description": "PocusVR brings POCUS (Point-of-Care Ultrasound) education directly to your space with cutting-edge virtual reality technology. Perfect for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "d